	(gr_text "Fab: JLCPCB\nStack-up: 4-layer, JLCPCB standard FR-4 (Dk ≈ 4.5, Df ≈ 0.02)\nCopper weight: 1oz (35µm) all layers\n\nImpedance control: USB D+/D-, RX+/RX-, TX+/TX-, SSRX+/SSRX-, SSTX+/SSTX-\ndifferential pairs, tightly coupled\n\nRouting style: Coplanar differential - edge-coupled pair with ground pour \nflanking both sides, same layer\n\nTarget impedance: 90Ω ±10% differential (USB 2.0 spec)\nTrace width: 0.162mm (6.4 mil)\nDifferential gap (DP spacing): 0.118mm (4.6 mil)\nGround clearance: 0.127mm (5.0 mil)\n\nNote to fab: {dblquote}Controlled Impedance - 90Ω ±10% differential, \ncoplanar pairs, W=0.162mm / S=0.118mm / \nclearance=0.127mm per attached stack-up{dblquote}\n\nSurface finish: ENIG recommended for fine-pitch USB-C connector pads\nSoldermask: Green\nSilkscreen: White (min 0.15mm line width)\nBOM/Parts sourcing: LCSC part numbers referenced in BOM for JLCPCB SMT assembly"
		(at 121.8055 81.163927 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "8dc70430-7457-402d-aa78-169ee0f11578")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
